{"data": [{"author_id": "1584093062040461312", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:12:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424672346349941"], "id": "2117424672346349941", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun 传统 Rag 也要被颠覆了吗？", "url": "https://x.com/AllenVibeX/status/2117424672346349941"}, {"author_id": "2117208752927440896", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:11:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117394228120559718"], "id": "2117394228120559718", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun Really interesting approach, especially the speed improvements.\n\nOne thing I'm curious about: what happens when the most relevant information belongs to multiple branches?\n\nWe're exploring a similar challenge at Twerity, where a single memory can connect to someone's", "url": "https://x.com/TwerityOfficial/status/2117394228120559718"}, {"author_id": "318891480", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:56:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117390330308051428"], "id": "2117390330308051428", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun 可以单独测一组跨分类的问题，记录正确段落在哪一层掉出了候选。总准确率之外，这个信息更容易判断该改分类结构，还是改每层的筛选策略。", "url": "https://x.com/growaiskills/status/2117390330308051428"}, {"author_id": "2004435780631146496", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:30:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117338474361553257"], "id": "2117338474361553257", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun 多了个裁判，错判也得认\n每步省一次检索，多一次判定调用\n阈值松一点就少查，紧一点就白查\n这架构真正的活不是加模型，是调那个够了的标准", "url": "https://x.com/himiaocc/status/2117338474361553257"}, {"author_id": "2079210929716101120", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:08:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117333008545911044"], "id": "2117333008545911044", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun Hey I'm already doing this with my agent 😅", "url": "https://x.com/Yaki_yakitori99/status/2117333008545911044"}, {"author_id": "1648903034691530752", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:59:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117300534483017844"], "id": "2117300534483017844", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun 快且准很难得", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoshan0413/status/2117300534483017844"}, {"author_id": "1587646529963106305", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:26:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117292258336936301"], "id": "2117292258336936301", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun 比维基自带搜索还准？那确实有点东西", "url": "https://x.com/zhouzhiquan521/status/2117292258336936301"}, {"author_id": "1585112383521189888", "conversation_id": "2117250771851022594", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:59:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117270314782707965"], "id": "2117270314782707965", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Gorden_Sun 决策场景用 RAG 做增强，这个方向很有想象空间", "url": "https://x.com